# SKULLPT — files that must never be committed.
#
# Joshua's rule (2026-11-13, immutable): sensitive information and APIs
# are NEVER in code. API keys and tokens live in the environment
# (GEMINI_API_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, HF_TOKEN) or in files listed here —
# never in a committed file.

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json
providers.json
*credentials*
*secret*

# Local install + run artifacts (created on the user's machine)
.venv/
install.log
test-output.log
.forge/

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Build outputs
*.zip
